Currnet I/O options should be supported equally on both the
DS20 and DS20E platform.  Future option are usually qualified
first on current generation systems, then later qualified on older
generation platforms, unless there is some unworkable problem.
Because most I/O options are for the PCI bus, they usually can
be made to work on any PCI-bus platform and simply a matter
of testing and qualification.



